Additional Recommendation

One important enhancement I'd add to this review is to require the platform to validate event consistency across all modules. Rather than each page maintaining its own state, every asset, CBOM entry, remediation task, migration job, and certification status should originate from a shared, authoritative data model and event stream. This helps ensure that when an asset is rescanned or migrated, every related page—from Assets and CBOM through Risk Analysis, Remediation, Live Migration, and Quantum Trust Certification—updates consistently without stale or conflicting information. This architectural approach is especially valuable when supporting large enterprises with tens of thousands of continuously changing assets.